   "line": [
    "g3",
    "Nf6",
    "Nc3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The Glek is launched with g3 — a fine opening at all levels; players rarely meet it and start floundering almost at once.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 9,
   "t": 402.5,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pppp1ppp/2n2n2/2b1p3/4P3/2N2NP1/PPPP1PBP/R1BQK2R b KQkq - 4 5",
   "line": [
